AArch64 MP+dmb.sy+addr
"Reader has an address dependency between the two loads; writer is fenced.
 Forbidden by RMO (address dependency preserved), allowed by Alpha (dependent
 loads are NOT ordered -- Alpha's defining relaxation)."
{ 0:X1=x; 0:X3=y; 1:X1=y; 1:X3=x; }
 P0           | P1                    ;
 MOV W0,#1    | LDR W0,[X1]           ;
 STR W0,[X1]  | EOR W4,W0,W0          ;
 DMB SY       | LDR W2,[X3,W4,SXTW]   ;
 MOV W2,#1    |                       ;
 STR W2,[X3]  |                       ;
exists (1:X0=1 /\ 1:X2=0)
